LZMA SDK

The LZMA encoder in this package's WebAssembly binary is compiled from the
LZMA SDK's C sources as 7-Zip 26.05 carries them (C/LzmaEnc.c, C/LzFind.c
and the headers they include), by Igor Pavlov. Each of those files states:

  Igor Pavlov : Public domain

They are in the public domain; no license is required to use, change or
distribute them. This notice records where they come from.

https://www.7-zip.org/sdk.html
https://github.com/ip7z/7zip/tree/26.05/C
